{"id":"dbdc45afd5f344e4","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-cor-holder-inequality.md","title":"Hölder's Inequality","display":"cor-holder-inequality — Hölder's Inequality","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-holder-inequality","aliases":["58-cor-holder-inequality"],"display":"cor-holder-inequality — Hölder's Inequality","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-conjugate-exponents.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-holder-inequality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-holder-inequality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-holder-inequality — Hölder's Inequality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fa2f4519ad363e1d\" href=\"?note=fa2f4519ad363e1d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-conjugate-exponents.md\">../batch09/58-df-conjugate-exponents.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\)</span> (measure-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in[1,\\infty]\">\\(p,q\\in[1,\\infty]\\)</span> (conjugate exponents)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_p,L_q,L_1\\in V\">\\(L_p,L_q,L_1\\in V\\)</span> (the quotient spaces supplied by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in L_p\">\\(F\\in L_p\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in L_q\">\\(G\\in L_q\\)</span> (almost-everywhere equivalence classes, not raw functions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\cdot G\">\\(F\\cdot G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lVert F\\rVert_{p;X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\">\\(\\lVert F\\rVert_{p;X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\\)</span> (the well-defined product class and quotient norm induced from measurable representatives)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConjugateExponents}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ConjugateExponents}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicates from the dependencies)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LpQuotientProductValue}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{LpQuotientProductValue}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\cdot G\">\\(F\\cdot G\\)</span> 只在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\)</span> 的可测等价类上使用；商范数记号与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a> 的范数按下式对接。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeClass}\">\\(\\mathrm{AeClass}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeEqual}\">\\(\\mathrm{AeEqual}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(F;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\n\\exists f\\in F\\;\\bigl(F=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LpQuotientProductValue}_S(H,F,G;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(F;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(G;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\land H=\\left\\{h\\in\\mathbb C^X:\\exists f\\in F\\;\\exists g\\in G\\;\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S\\left(h,\\{\\langle x,f(x)g(x)\\rangle:x\\in X\\};X,\\Sigma,\\mu\\right)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(F;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\n\\exists f\\in F\\;\\bigl(F=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LpQuotientProductValue}_S(H,F,G;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(F;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(G;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\land H=\\left\\{h\\in\\mathbb C^X:\\exists f\\in F\\;\\exists g\\in G\\;\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S\\left(h,\\{\\langle x,f(x)g(x)\\rangle:x\\in X\\};X,\\Sigma,\\mu\\right)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(F;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(G;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to F\\cdot G\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup\\{H\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb C^X):\\mathrm{LpQuotientProductValue}_S(H,F,G;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(F;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(G;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to F\\cdot G\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup\\{H\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb C^X):\\mathrm{LpQuotientProductValue}_S(H,F,G;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L,p;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land F\\in L\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\lVert F\\rVert_{p;X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\\coloneqq\n\\lVert F\\rVert_{L^p(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L,p;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land F\\in L\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\lVert F\\rVert_{p;X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\\coloneqq\n\\lVert F\\rVert_{L^p(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}holder\\text{-}product\\text{-}representatives}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(F;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(G;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\nF\\cdot G=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S\\left(\\{\\langle x,f(x)g(x)\\rangle:x\\in X\\};X,\\Sigma,\\mu\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}holder\\text{-}product\\text{-}representatives}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(F;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasurableAeClass}_S(G;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\nF\\cdot G=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S\\left(\\{\\langle x,f(x)g(x)\\rangle:x\\in X\\};X,\\Sigma,\\mu\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}holder\\text{-}inequality}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ConjugateExponents}_S(p,q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L_p,p;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L_q,q;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L_1,1;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land F\\in L_p\\land G\\in L_q\\\\\n&amp;\\to F\\cdot G\\in L_1\n\\land\\lVert F\\cdot G\\rVert_{1;X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\n\\leq\n\\lVert F\\rVert_{p;X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\n\\lVert G\\rVert_{q;X,\\Sigma,\\mu}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}holder\\text{-}inequality}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ConjugateExponents}_S(p,q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L_p,p;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L_q,q;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L_1,1;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land F\\in L_p\\land G\\in L_q\\\\\n&amp;\\to F\\cdot G\\in L_1\n\\land\\lVert F\\cdot G\\rVert_{1;X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\n\\leq\n\\lVert F\\rVert_{p;X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\n\\lVert G\\rVert_{q;X,\\Sigma,\\mu}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>乘法仍作用于原来的几乎处处等价类。Assertion 给出其精确集合值及与任意可测代表元的对应式；不需要读取本节来解释商乘法或范数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading"